[Term]
id: GO:0072268
name: pattern specification involved in metanephros development
namespace: biological_process
def: "Any developmental process that results in the creation of defined areas or spaces within the metanephros to which cells respond and eventually are instructed to differentiate." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
