[Term]
id: GO:0072285
name: mesenchymal to epithelial transition involved in metanephric renal vesicle formation
namespace: biological_process
def: "A transition where a mesenchymal cell establishes apical/basolateral polarity,forms intercellular adhesive junctions, synthesizes basement membrane components and becomes an epithelial cell that will contribute to the shaping of the metanephric renal vesicle." [GOC:mtg_kidney_jan10]
