relationship: BFO:0000050 UBERON:0001849 {source="FMA"} ! part of membranous labyrinth
relationship: RO:0001025 UBERON:0001844 ! located in cochlea
property_value: foaf:depiction "http://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/Gray923.png" xsd:anyURI
property_value: IAO:0000116 "we follow the FMA in placing this in the membranous labyrinth. Notes: The labyrinth can be divided by layer or by region. Bony vs. membranous / Vestibular vs. cochlear" xsd:string

