[Term]
id: UBERON:0005124
name: metanephric proximal convoluted tubule
def: "The metanephric proximal convoluted tubule is the most proximal portion of the metanephric proximal tubule and extends from the metanephric glomerular capsule to the metanephric proximal straight tubule[GO]." [GO:0072229]
