[Term]
id: UBERON:0005125
name: metanephric proximal straight tubule
def: "The metanephric proximal straight tubule is the part of the metanephric descending limb that extends from the metanephric proximal convoluted tubule to the metanephric descending thin tubule[GO]." [GO:0072230]
