intersection_of: UBERON:0000074 ! renal glomerulus
intersection_of: BFO:0000050 UBERON:0000080 ! part of mesonephros
relationship: BFO:0000050 UBERON:0000080 ! part of mesonephros

[Term]
id: UBERON:0005326
name: mesonephric glomerulus vasculature
def: "The mesonephric glomerulus vasculature is composed of the tubule structures that carry blood or lymph in the mesonephric glomerulus[GO]." [GO:0061231]
