[Term]
id: UBERON:0005327
name: mesonephric glomerular epithelium
def: "A mesonephric glomerular visceral epithelial cell is a specialized epithelial cell that contains 'feet' that interdigitate with the 'feet' of other glomerular epithelial cells in the mesonephros[GO]." [GO:0061232]
