intersection_of: UBERON:0001851 ! cortex
intersection_of: BFO:0000050 UBERON:0000992 ! part of ovary
relationship: BFO:0000050 UBERON:0006960 ! part of ovary stroma
property_value: RO:0002175 NCBITaxon:9606

[Term]
id: UBERON:0013192
name: ovarian medulla
def: "Highly vascular stroma found in the center of the ovary that forms from embryonic mesenchyme and contains blood vessels, lymphatic vessels, and nerves; this stroma forms the tissue of the hilum by which the ovarian ligament is attached, and through which the blood vessels enter; it does not contain any ovarian follicles." [MGI:anna]
subset: pheno_slim
synonym: "medulla of ovary" EXACT [FMA:18616]
synonym: "medulla ovarii (zona vasculosa)" EXACT [FMA:18616]
synonym: "zona vasculosa of Waldeyer" RELATED [Wikipedia:Medulla_of_ovary]
